o the answer should be C.\n</think>\n\nThe paragraph discusses the effects of hot and humid weather during the Indian summer on cardiovascular and cerebrovascular diseases. It links reduced oxygen content, increased humidity, lack of sleep, and work stress to these conditions. The **best heading** that captures this focus on the causes of these health issues is **C: Cause of cardiovascular and cerebrovascular diseases**.\n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{C}",
