e exactly one correct guess. So this is a valid solution.\n\nSo the assignments would be:\n\nZhao Ming: PKU\n\nQian Hong: THU\n\nSun Jie: BNU\n\nBut let's check the options given. The options are:\n\nA) PKU, BNU, THU\n\nB) THU, BNU, PKU\n\nC) BNU, THU, PKU\n\nD) PKU, THU, BNU\n\nWait, in our solution, Zhao Ming is at PKU, Qian Hong at THU, Sun Jie at BNU. So that's option D: Zhao Ming-PKU, Qian Hong-THU, Sun Jie-BNU. But looking at the options:\n\nOption D says: Zhao Ming, Qian Hong and Sun Jie were admitted to peking university, thinghua university and beijing normal university respectively.\n\nWait, but in our solution, Qian Hong is at THU, which is option D's second university. So the order is Zhao Ming-PKU, Qian Hong-THU, Sun Jie-BNU. So the correct order is D.\n\nBut let me check the options again:\n\nA) Zhao Ming-PKU, Qian Hong-BNU, Sun Jie-THU\n\nB) Zhao Ming-THU, Qian Hong-BNU, Sun Jie-PKU\n\nC) Zhao Ming-BNU, Qian Hong-THU, Sun Jie-PKU\n\nD) Zhao Ming-PKU, Qian Hong-BNU, Sun Jie-THU\n\nWait, no. Wait, in our solution, Zhao Ming is at PKU, Qian Hong at THU, Sun Jie at BNU. So the correct order is Zhao Ming-PKU, Qian Hong-THU, Sun Jie-BNU. But looking at the options, option D is Zhao Ming-PKU, Qian Hong-BNU, Sun Jie-THU. That's not matching. Wait, maybe I made a mistake here.\n\nWait, let's check the options again:\n\nOptions:\n\nA) Zhao Ming: PKU, Qian Hong: BNU, Sun Jie: THU\n\nB) Zhao Ming: THU, Qian Hong: BNU, Sun Jie: PKU\n\nC) Zhao Ming: BNU, Qian Hong: THU, Sun Jie: PKU\n\nD) Zhao Ming: PKU, Qian Hong: BNU, Sun Jie: THU\n\nWait, in our solution, Zhao Ming is at PKU, Qian Hong at THU, Sun Jie at BNU. So that would correspond to option D's order: Zhao Ming-PKU, Qian Hong-BNU, Sun Jie-THU. Wait, no. Option D is Zhao Ming-PKU, Qian Hong-BNU, Sun Jie-THU. So Qian Hong is at BNU and Sun Jie is at THU. But in our solution, Qian Hong is at THU and Sun Jie is at BNU. So that's different.\n\nWait, perhaps I made a mistake in the order. Let me check again.\n\nWai